WEBVTT

00:09.240 --> 00:10.820
Good, you came!

00:12.910 --> 00:14.410
Terakomari.

00:17.500 --> 00:18.370
Vill!

00:18.710 --> 00:21.830
Oh my, no need to get upset.

00:21.830 --> 00:23.670
She isn't dead yet.

00:24.130 --> 00:25.800
I will kill her eventually, though.

00:32.759 --> 00:33.970
Give me back Vill!

00:35.810 --> 00:38.980
Come now, there's no need to rush.

00:40.350 --> 00:43.360
We finally have this chance
to talk in private.

00:44.480 --> 00:45.660
So, Terakomari.

00:46.440 --> 00:51.860
Do you have any idea how much pain
I've been through since that day?

00:51.860 --> 00:53.620
That day? When was that?

00:54.200 --> 00:55.870
Three years ago today.

00:55.870 --> 01:00.400
I'm talking about the day
I tried to take that pendant of yours.

01:02.020 --> 01:03.770
You must become strong.

01:03.770 --> 01:05.400
Stronger than anyone else.

01:06.710 --> 01:08.920
#4 CRIMSON RESENTMENT
Yes, Father.

01:09.800 --> 01:12.430
My father's teachings were simple.

01:13.180 --> 01:16.060
The Bluenights are
a family of politicians.

01:16.060 --> 01:19.270
In a vampire society
where force reigns supreme,

01:19.270 --> 01:22.540
the fact is that weak politicians
are picked on and eaten.

01:24.270 --> 01:28.610
The person over there who has come
all the way from Divine Paradise...

01:28.610 --> 01:30.700
is Mr. Amatsu.

01:31.280 --> 01:34.740
Starting today,
he will give you lessons in fighting.

01:34.740 --> 01:36.660
Do not bring us shame.

01:40.830 --> 01:42.580
My name is Kakumei Amatsu.

01:43.330 --> 01:44.080
Nice to meet you.

01:46.000 --> 01:48.590
N-Nice to meet—

02:05.360 --> 02:09.860
Your father hopes that you have
special powers within you.

02:11.280 --> 02:14.200
Special... powers?

02:14.700 --> 02:17.530
It's a supernatural ability
called 'Rekkaku Liberation.'

02:18.530 --> 02:20.700
Rekkaku Liberation.

02:20.700 --> 02:23.980
A special ability that deviates
from all the laws of this world.

02:24.500 --> 02:27.920
It is said that once used,

02:27.920 --> 02:30.630
it has the power to pierce
the Earth and move stars.

02:32.470 --> 02:36.930
The likelihood that a person has
this ability innately is extremely low.

02:38.070 --> 02:42.850
However, our research has revealed
that if you undergo special training,

02:42.850 --> 02:45.080
you can acquire this power.

02:46.490 --> 02:49.400
What is the special training?

02:49.400 --> 02:52.460
Cultivating a spirit of resilience
in the face of adversity.

02:53.570 --> 02:59.160
It seems that the state of one's mind is
deeply related to the Rekkaku Liberation.

02:59.160 --> 03:02.790
And the quickest way
to train your mind...

03:04.460 --> 03:07.630
is to threaten your life!

03:08.080 --> 03:10.050
This is called a Sacred Article.

03:10.050 --> 03:14.190
It is an item capable of causing damage
that can't be healed by Magic Cores.

03:14.190 --> 03:17.180
By enduring the pain
of a wound that won't heal,

03:17.180 --> 03:19.510
the mind can be trained.

03:24.350 --> 03:27.020
Please train me, Mr. Amatsu.

03:32.240 --> 03:35.360
It's already been one month
since Mr. Amatsu arrived!

03:35.360 --> 03:38.240
Why can't you use
the Rekkaku Liberation yet?!

03:38.950 --> 03:41.950
The Gandesbloods
will be laughing at us!

03:41.950 --> 03:44.660
With such a mess of an heir!

03:45.710 --> 03:47.000
Damn it!

03:47.000 --> 03:51.090
You are a complete failure compared to
the daughter of the Gandesbloods!

03:53.170 --> 03:54.800
F-Father...

04:02.640 --> 04:05.430
Hey, you hear about the kid
in the class next door?

04:05.430 --> 04:08.100
They say she can use magic
that others can't!

04:08.730 --> 04:10.860
Are you talking about advanced magic?

04:10.860 --> 04:12.520
That is cool, but...

04:12.520 --> 04:16.610
No, no. Not that, it was Retsu...

04:16.610 --> 04:17.740
Rekkaku?

04:17.740 --> 04:19.320
Rekkaku Liberation?!

04:19.320 --> 04:20.620
Oh yeah, that's it!

04:22.160 --> 04:25.620
Can you tell me everything
you heard about her?

04:27.830 --> 04:29.990
Whatever, hurry up and show me.

04:31.460 --> 04:33.340
Please drink my blood.

04:33.840 --> 04:34.750
Huh?

04:34.750 --> 04:39.760
My Rekkaku Liberation allows me to see
the future of those who drink my blood.

04:39.760 --> 04:41.260
Pandora Poison.

04:42.090 --> 04:46.640
If it's about what's going to happen today,
my accuracy rate is 100%.

04:46.640 --> 04:47.180
Oh?

04:52.270 --> 04:53.520
I see your future.

04:55.400 --> 04:56.650
What can you see?

04:57.110 --> 04:58.080
This is...

04:59.070 --> 04:59.780
Umm.

04:59.780 --> 05:02.870
What is it?
Stop holding back and tell me!

05:02.870 --> 05:03.890
Okay.

05:06.250 --> 05:09.290
You are a pitiful person.

05:11.750 --> 05:12.630
Huh?!

05:14.920 --> 05:18.800
This one is no good.
She's broken.

05:18.800 --> 05:20.720
It's no fun if she doesn't react.

05:20.720 --> 05:22.430
Should we kill her, then?

05:24.760 --> 05:27.060
Shall I blow your head off?!

05:27.600 --> 05:29.600
Stop...

05:32.980 --> 05:33.850
Stop it!

05:36.070 --> 05:37.980
Ms. Gandesblood!

05:37.980 --> 05:38.900
This is, umm...

05:38.900 --> 05:41.320
Gandesblood?!

05:42.110 --> 05:43.250
This brat

05:43.740 --> 05:46.060
is the daughter of the Gandesbloods?!

05:48.290 --> 05:50.660
We've come this far
and now I'm sure.

05:50.660 --> 05:54.960
It seems you do not have the ability
to evoke the Rekkaku Liberation.

05:55.960 --> 05:58.750
That's not to say you
don't show promise.

05:58.750 --> 06:02.710
You have other talents
that anyone would be envious of.

06:04.510 --> 06:06.550
What should I do then?

06:06.550 --> 06:08.720
Act freely, my dear.

06:08.720 --> 06:13.100
Admire the things you love
and kill the things you hate.

06:14.020 --> 06:16.480
Is there someone you'd like to kill?

06:19.530 --> 06:23.820
In that case,
do whatever it takes to kill them.

06:25.660 --> 06:29.580
Come on! If you want this to stop,
use your Rekkaku Liberation or something!

06:29.580 --> 06:32.330
Let's see you put up a fight!

06:32.330 --> 06:33.250
I pity you.

06:33.250 --> 06:36.330
Huh, what was that?
I didn't hear you.

06:38.290 --> 06:40.250
I pity you.

06:40.760 --> 06:43.510
Is there something troubling you?

06:46.930 --> 06:49.970
In order to force Terakomari's
spirit to submit to me,

06:49.970 --> 06:54.690
I thoroughly investigated
her lineage and history.

06:55.850 --> 07:00.730
I learned that the pendant was
a keepsake of Terakomari's mother.

07:01.110 --> 07:03.740
Hey, you mind if I borrow...

07:04.450 --> 07:05.570
that pendant?

07:07.370 --> 07:10.330
After that I can't seem
to remember what happened.

07:11.950 --> 07:13.950
Afterwards I learned that

07:13.950 --> 07:18.960
I died after Terakomari evoked
her Rekkaku Liberation.

07:21.840 --> 07:25.720
My life changed forever that day.

07:26.800 --> 07:28.470
Your goddamn father

07:28.470 --> 07:33.640
falsely accused my family of treason
and deported them.

07:35.690 --> 07:38.480
Kicked out of the academy,
kicked out of the country,

07:38.480 --> 07:42.020
my family was separated
and we had nowhere to go.

07:42.020 --> 07:44.070
I finally ended up

07:44.610 --> 07:47.860
part of the terrorist organization,
The Inverted Moon.

07:47.860 --> 07:52.200
While you were enjoying
the elegant life of a shut-in,

07:52.200 --> 07:56.900
I was experiencing my fill of malice
that the world has to offer.

07:57.540 --> 08:02.290
There has been an unchanging conviction
in my heart for the past three years.

08:02.800 --> 08:05.260
I will exact my revenge.

08:05.260 --> 08:06.630
A conviction to kill you.

08:07.290 --> 08:08.760
That is all.

08:09.470 --> 08:13.850
Oh, so she is actually similar to me.

08:14.140 --> 08:17.600
Someone who is lost,
who can't live in the moment,

08:17.600 --> 08:21.610
and who can't escape from the trauma
of what happened three years ago.

08:22.060 --> 08:24.150
What are you doing, Terakomari?!

08:25.780 --> 08:28.200
You! Why are you here?

08:28.200 --> 08:29.860
It doesn't matter!

08:29.860 --> 08:34.080
You need to run away!
She's crazy and she has a Sacred Article!

08:34.700 --> 08:37.370
Just look at this wound on my stomach.

08:37.370 --> 08:40.580
It hurts and it isn't healing.

08:42.130 --> 08:43.250
I see.

08:44.920 --> 08:45.920
I'm sorry I'm late.

08:46.550 --> 08:48.970
I'm going to help,
so stay right there.

08:49.840 --> 08:52.550
Don't... Don't be stupid!

08:52.550 --> 08:56.220
I was helping her
so that we could kill you.

08:56.220 --> 08:57.060
Despite that, you—

08:57.350 --> 08:58.270
Eh?!

09:00.560 --> 09:03.020
Shut up you noisy gnat.

09:03.520 --> 09:07.610
I'm about to fight
Terakomari to the death.

09:22.370 --> 09:23.480
I'm sorry.

09:23.480 --> 09:27.460
If you die now, you'll be safe
by the time you revive.

09:28.630 --> 09:29.990
A Magic Stone?

09:32.220 --> 09:34.510
Well done, Terakomari.

09:34.510 --> 09:38.550
I see you've actually
come prepared to fight.

10:06.130 --> 10:11.510
Come now! How long will you be hiding
like a rat?! Come out and play!

10:11.510 --> 10:15.140
You precious little maid
is going to get killed!

10:22.890 --> 10:24.020
Okay, next is—

10:34.780 --> 10:36.530
What are you doing?

10:36.950 --> 10:40.450
It's no fun if you die
so quickly, you know.

10:50.840 --> 10:51.780
Vill!

10:53.970 --> 10:56.680
Hmm? You can still stand?

10:56.680 --> 10:58.350
Well done.

10:58.850 --> 11:01.100
I won't lose!

11:01.520 --> 11:04.310
You have more guts than I thought.

11:04.310 --> 11:06.770
Where would you like
to be shot next?

11:07.480 --> 11:09.690
Your chest? Your stomach?

11:09.690 --> 11:11.610
Or right in the face?

11:11.610 --> 11:15.860
It'll be fun to ruin a beauty that comes
around only once in ten billion years.

11:17.240 --> 11:19.920
You're wrong.

11:19.920 --> 11:20.450
Huh?

11:20.450 --> 11:23.660
It's not ten billion years.
It's a hundred million.

11:23.660 --> 11:26.250
Your attempt at humility disgusts me.

11:26.670 --> 11:30.790
I'm ten billion times
more disgusted with you!

11:30.790 --> 11:34.090
Oho? A special attack?!
I think you've lost your mind!

11:35.280 --> 11:36.680
Explode! Magic Stones!

11:38.260 --> 11:40.050
What a petty attempt.

11:40.050 --> 11:42.180
Shock Wave!

11:44.850 --> 11:48.440
Get crushed! Millicent!

12:05.540 --> 12:06.740
I did it.

12:08.920 --> 12:11.290
Vill, are you okay?!

12:11.290 --> 12:12.210
Vill!

12:22.760 --> 12:24.770
You've done such a good job,

12:24.770 --> 12:27.270
Terakomari!

12:31.110 --> 12:35.810
Oh, where do you think you're going,
little miss Terakomari?!

12:38.280 --> 12:40.410
If you think you can kill me

12:40.410 --> 12:44.660
with such a low-grade magic stone,
you're sadly mistaken.

12:45.240 --> 12:48.210
Does it hurt?
It hurts a lot, doesn't it?

12:48.210 --> 12:51.420
Just look at all the blood you're losing.

12:51.420 --> 12:53.380
S-Stop...

12:53.380 --> 12:56.380
I'm not stopping you, idiot!

12:56.380 --> 13:00.260
You're three years
too late to kill me.

13:00.260 --> 13:04.640
Weaklings like you are meant
to be killed like the insects you are.

13:04.640 --> 13:07.600
Like you never existed
in the first place.

13:10.480 --> 13:14.770
Crying? I knew it.
You're a real worthless piece of trash.

13:14.770 --> 13:17.340
You think crying will save you?

13:17.940 --> 13:21.700
I'm telling you,
the world is not that easy.

13:22.000 --> 13:24.830
Even if you cry,
nobody is coming to save you.

13:24.830 --> 13:27.620
You'll only ever be
able to rely on yourself.

13:28.370 --> 13:29.330
Shut up! Shut up!

13:29.330 --> 13:30.750
Don't get smart with me!

13:32.880 --> 13:36.050
How about you just use
your Rekkaku Liberation now?

13:37.800 --> 13:39.300
I don't know.

13:40.130 --> 13:42.680
I don't know what you're talking about!

13:42.680 --> 13:45.800
You really do seem to know nothing.

13:45.800 --> 13:50.600
Didn't you come here thinking you could
beat me because of your Rekkaku Liberation?

13:51.190 --> 13:53.520
I came for Vill—

13:55.810 --> 13:59.400
I came all this way to save Vill.

14:01.990 --> 14:05.700
I've always been short,
lack physical talents,

14:05.700 --> 14:08.870
unable to use any magic,
and in general a bad vampire.

14:09.450 --> 14:12.460
Coming here was really scary.

14:12.460 --> 14:17.000
My legs were trembling and I thought of
turning back multiple times.

14:17.540 --> 14:18.460
But...

14:19.920 --> 14:22.470
I can't stand to run away anymore!

14:23.720 --> 14:27.140
I'm weak.
I know that well enough.

14:28.060 --> 14:29.930
But I have to try.

14:30.390 --> 14:34.020
For the people who care about me.

14:34.020 --> 14:36.520
I know I have to do my best!

14:39.570 --> 14:42.250
I can't take this.
I really can't stand this.

14:42.250 --> 14:44.070
Alright then,

14:44.860 --> 14:46.820
I'll just kill the maid first.

14:47.780 --> 14:48.660
No, stop!

14:48.660 --> 14:51.540
Watch closely, Terakomari!

14:51.540 --> 14:55.580
Your precious maid is about
to be reduced to a heap of meat!

14:55.580 --> 14:57.710
I won't let you lay a hand on Vill!

14:58.750 --> 15:00.170
Shut up you vexing brat!

15:04.840 --> 15:07.800
I can... I can still fight.

15:08.180 --> 15:12.020
I said shut up!

15:24.650 --> 15:26.110
There's no way...

15:26.450 --> 15:29.780
There's no way
I'm leaving here without Vill!

15:29.780 --> 15:32.450
Acting all righteous,
but you're just a simple shut-in!

15:32.450 --> 15:34.540
I'm not a shut-in!

15:34.540 --> 15:38.210
I'm going to defeat you
and turn over a new leaf!

15:38.210 --> 15:42.630
If you think you can do it,
then do it!!

15:57.940 --> 16:02.570
So is this how I die?

16:02.570 --> 16:06.860
Without being able to defeat
Millicent or save Vill?

16:06.860 --> 16:09.820
As a helpless little shut-in?

16:11.330 --> 16:13.830
That's, not what I want.

16:14.540 --> 16:16.040
Lady Komari.

16:17.870 --> 16:22.040
You are the strongest
and kindest person in the world.

16:22.040 --> 16:28.680
But you lack confidence and always end up
with that anxious look on your face.

16:33.220 --> 16:34.930
V-Vill...

16:35.470 --> 16:38.310
So you're still alive?!

16:38.310 --> 16:41.060
Forgive me Lady Komari.

16:41.650 --> 16:45.230
I'm ready to receive
any punishment for you.

16:52.870 --> 16:54.000
Lady Komari.

16:54.530 --> 16:56.620
You will not lose.

17:02.210 --> 17:05.300
Oh, this is so exciting!

17:05.710 --> 17:08.550
Hurry up and show me, Terakomari.

17:08.550 --> 17:13.260
The supreme Rekkaku Liberation,
unprecedented in the history of the Empire.

17:13.260 --> 17:16.720
The full power of
'The Solitary Crimson Sky.'

17:26.550 --> 17:27.359
I'm killing you.

17:35.870 --> 17:36.700
What is that?!

17:37.240 --> 17:39.710
- Is this the Rekkaku Liber—
- I'm killing you.

17:42.500 --> 17:46.880
What happened?!
Her magical power has suddenly grown!

17:47.590 --> 17:51.340
That's right, just like back then.

17:53.170 --> 17:54.140
This brat.

17:55.310 --> 17:56.560
She drank my blood.

17:57.600 --> 17:59.310
- Millicent.
- Eh?

18:01.310 --> 18:03.020
You really are a pitiful person.

18:04.690 --> 18:05.610
Wha?

18:06.960 --> 18:09.480
You shitty little brat!

18:13.360 --> 18:14.610
Your Excellency!

18:14.610 --> 18:16.460
We're sorry, Your Excellency!

18:16.460 --> 18:19.070
Even against your orders,
we want to be of aid!

18:22.790 --> 18:26.040
That's special grade magic,
'Annihilating Flame!'

18:26.040 --> 18:27.500
Please run, Your Excellency!

18:27.500 --> 18:31.590
I will destroy you!

18:38.260 --> 18:43.560
♪ Running through this fate with you ♪

18:45.600 --> 18:48.110
That was too intense YO!

18:48.110 --> 18:50.690
Whoa!

18:51.750 --> 18:53.660
Y-You!

19:03.910 --> 19:05.710
You've gotta be...

19:05.710 --> 19:08.170
You've gotta be kidding?!

19:09.000 --> 19:10.000
It's all over.

19:11.590 --> 19:12.590
That's right.

19:14.590 --> 19:17.300
Just die, Terakomari!

19:22.180 --> 19:24.890
Ah... Oh....

19:25.650 --> 19:31.020
It seems that the state of one's mind is
deeply related to the Rekkaku Liberation.

19:31.020 --> 19:36.700
I know I have to try my best
for the people who care about me!

19:36.970 --> 19:39.700
Ah, so that's why.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.790
Prepare yourself.

19:42.790 --> 19:45.620
The one who was weak...

19:49.170 --> 19:50.790
was me after all.

19:51.800 --> 19:54.840
If only I had taken a different approach,

19:56.760 --> 20:00.900
I would have had a different future.

20:03.350 --> 20:04.390
With this,

20:04.850 --> 20:06.540
I give you peace.

20:17.200 --> 20:18.270
Lady Komari.

20:19.110 --> 20:20.450
Are you awake?

20:20.450 --> 20:21.830
Vill!

20:21.830 --> 20:22.950
Are you okay—

20:23.660 --> 20:26.080
It hurts!

20:26.620 --> 20:30.540
Please stay still.
Your wounds haven't healed yet.

20:33.960 --> 20:36.420
Vill, is this Heaven?

20:36.880 --> 20:38.430
No, this is reality.

20:38.430 --> 20:40.430
You won, Lady Komari.

20:40.430 --> 20:42.220
Huh? What did I win at?

20:44.510 --> 20:49.140
Komari evoked the Rekkaku Liberation
for the first time when she was three.

20:50.310 --> 20:53.400
At dinner, she drank blood
for the first time,

20:53.400 --> 20:56.940
and killed all of us
who were in the room.

20:58.570 --> 20:59.900
Immediately after that,

20:59.900 --> 21:03.030
we hypnotized Komari
so that she would hate blood.

21:03.780 --> 21:07.450
I don't want her to have a hard time.

21:08.320 --> 21:13.530
If she doesn't remember the Rekkaku Liberation,
it's best to leave it that way.

21:14.710 --> 21:17.590
Come on, what did I beat?

21:18.130 --> 21:19.840
The past.

21:20.430 --> 21:21.760
The past?

21:24.800 --> 21:29.600
The Mulnite Empire detains
the woman from the 'Inverted Moon.'

21:30.060 --> 21:33.110
Someone came to help, I guess.

21:34.190 --> 21:37.110
By the way, what will you do now?

21:37.110 --> 21:37.650
Eh?

21:37.650 --> 21:40.740
Everything from three years ago
is wrapped up.

21:40.740 --> 21:44.030
- There's no need for you to stay my maid—
- No way!

21:44.030 --> 21:46.410
Do you mean to say
you're done with me?

21:46.410 --> 21:47.790
No that's not—

21:47.790 --> 21:52.750
I'll have no choice but to become a thief,
break-in, and steal your panties!

21:52.750 --> 21:56.880
At least steal something valuable!
If you say that again, I'll really fire you!

21:58.920 --> 22:00.630
Alright, alright.

22:01.800 --> 22:05.510
You'll be my maid from now on, too.

22:05.510 --> 22:08.520
So always stay by my side, okay?

22:09.560 --> 22:12.460
I'm relying on you, Vill.

22:14.400 --> 22:17.440
Huh? Was that a proposal?!

22:19.110 --> 22:21.970
How could you possibly think that?!

23:57.250 --> 23:59.920
#5 SAKUNA MEMOIR AND THE CRIMSON LORDS
'Sakuna Memoir and the Crimson Lords.'
